From 89b1db4fed04246d18beb50661265184d4b740a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Catherine Grabar <catherine.grabar@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:56:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] Regenerate stale visual baseline; ignore diff artifacts

The committed baseline predated upstream's own HUD changes (old crop
roster, no weather display), so the visual test always failed. New
baseline captured from the current build; a second run passes. Failure
artifact diff_current.png is gitignored.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .gitignore             |   1 +
 tools/baseline.png     | Bin 21536 -> 25642 bytes
 tools/diff_current.png | Bin 23007 -> 0 bytes
 3 files changed, 1 insertion(+)
 delete mode 100644 tools/diff_current.png

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index 52691e5..37c422a 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
 .DS_Store
 diff.txt
 diff_2.txt
+tools/diff_current.png
diff --git a/tools/baseline.png b/tools/baseline.png
